OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CThe remote village helping pensioners  
OL,5,Cstay stronger                          
OL,6,GWith the nearest major hospital 30     
OL,7,Gmiles away and ambulance delays a      
OL,8,Greality for some residents, a village  
OL,9,Gon Exmoor is taking steps to help      
OL,10,Golder people stay healthy, active and  
OL,11,Gindependent.                           
OL,13,FThe Stronger for Longer campaign in    
OL,14,FPorlock encourages people to improve   
OL,15,Ftheir strength and balance to reduce   
OL,16,Fthe risk of falls and remain in their  
OL,17,Fown homes for longer.                  
OL,19,FSupporters say the initiative could    
OL,20,Fhelp residents stay independent in a   
OL,21,Fcommunity where access to emergency    
OL,22,Fcare can be difficult.            G1/4 
