OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CBoys arrested after fire at BBC series 
OL,5,Ccommunity centre                       
OL,6,GThree boys have been arrested on       
OL,7,Gsuspicion of arson after a fire broke  
OL,8,Gout at a disused community centre that 
OL,9,Gfeatured in the BBC series The Outlaws.
OL,11,FThe fire happened at Sea Mills         
OL,12,FCommunity Centre in Sunny Hill, Sea    
OL,13,FMills, on Tuesday evening.             
OL,15,FAvon and Somerset Police said the      
OL,16,Fbuilding was "well alight" when        
OL,17,Femergency services arrived, and        
OL,18,Fresidents of 10 neighbouring           
OL,19,Fproperties were evacuated due to       
OL,20,Fconcerns around asbestos. They have    
OL,21,Fsince returned home and no injuries    
OL,22,Fwere reported.                    G3/4 
