OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CFestive market cancels bookings after  
OL,5,CAI backlash                            
OL,6,GThe organisers of a Christmas market   
OL,7,Ghave cancelled all bookings and        
OL,8,Gpromised to refund stallholders        
OL,9,Gfollowing a backlash to AI-generated   
OL,10,Gpromotional materials.                 
OL,12,FDavid Rowland, who produced the images 
OL,13,Ffor Kernow Christmas Market in Pool,   
OL,14,FCornwall, said claims they did not     
OL,15,Fmatch reality were a "lesson learned". 
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
